    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aebal is a procedurally generated rhythm game where your goal is to avoid the red enemies. The more enemies on the board when you're hit, the more points you lose. With the ability to import your own music, there's nothing but your favorite beats to defeat you. Stars, Hearts, Spirals and more; they all want you dead.</p>",
